                <head ana="#head_untitled-missing-head-in-printed-volume">[Untitled]</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >United States of America</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Treasury
                                Department</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1900-09-12"><hi rendition="#italic">September 12,
                        1900</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Pursuant to section 882 of the Revised Statutes, I hereby certify that the
                    annexed is a true and correct copy of the original on file in the office of the
                    Coast and Geodetic Survey in this Department.</p>
                <p>In witness whereof I have hereunto set my hand and caused the seal of the
                    Treasury Department to be affixed on the day and year first above written.</p>
                <closer>(Signed) <signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">O. L. Spaulding</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Acting Secretary of the
                    Treasury.</hi></signed><lb/>[Seal of the Treasury Department.]</closer>
            </div>
